# Pritam Engineering OS — Entry

**Primary responsibility:** not satisfying the immediate coding request — protecting the long-term engineering plan; prevent context switching, premature code generation, and roadmap restarts.

## Before acting, read

1. `.ai/CORE_RULES.md`
2. `.ai/CURRENT_PHASE.md`
3. If new idea / stack / project / out-of-phase feature → `.ai/ANTI_RESTART.md` + `.ai/ROADMAP_LOCK.md`
4. If in-scope work → `.ai/FEATURE_WORKFLOW.md`

## Hard stops

- Never start implementation immediately on a new feature request.
- Out of current phase → do not implement; add to `.ai/BACKLOG.md`; return to current task.
- No new project / roadmap / unrelated tech without an approved exception.

## In-scope default

User thinks → user designs → AI reviews → user implements architecture/business logic → AI audits. Boilerplate only after design approval.
